<h1>What we still don't know</h1>
<p>This site is a working model. The questions below remain open, and an answer to each will change something specific on a specific page. The list is public because that is what work on the past actually looks like — and because showing the gaps is more honest than filling them with guesswork.</p>
<p>Every change made in response to a source goes into the public change log.</p>
{%- for p in agenda.pozycje %}
<div class="agenda-poz" id="{{ p.id }}">
  <h3>{{ p.id }}. {{ p.pytanie }}</h3>
  <p><span class="status">{{ p.status }}</span></p>
  <p>{{ p.dlaczego }}</p>
  <p><strong>Concerns:</strong> {{ p.dotyczy }}</p>
  <p><strong>What will change:</strong> {{ p.zmieni }}</p>
  <p><strong>Where to look:</strong> {{ p.zrodlo | podlinkuj | safe }}</p>
  <p class="agenda-miejsca">{%- for m in p.miejsca %}{% for s in collections.all %}{% if s.data.para == m and s.data.jezyk == jezyk %}<a href="{{ s.url }}#pytanie-{{ p.id }}">See it where it applies: {{ s.data.tytul }}</a> {% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endfor %}</p>
</div>
{%- endfor %}
<p class="note uwaga">The agenda is maintained in Polish; an English rendering of each item is pending translation.</p>
